            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. If the parties do not agree upon an impartial arbitrator within seven (7) days, the matter shall be submitted to the American Arbitration Association for appointment of an arbitrator and for hearings in accordance with its rules.",
            "block_bbox": [
