        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "E. The decision of the Arbitrator shall be final and binding upon the parties hereto and upon any Employee, or Employees, affected thereby. The Arbitrator shall, however, have no power either to add to or subtract from, or to modify any of the terms of this Agreement, or any Agreement made supplementary thereto. If either party contends that the above provision has been violated, the matter may be referred to any court of competent jurisdiction which shall have the power to determine the question and which shall interpret this agreement in accordance with the commonly accepted meaning of the words used herein and the principle that the parties are agreed that there are no restrictions intended on the management of",
